          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جبران کردن (jobrân kardan) — \"to make up for, to make amends for\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "هتل اشتباهش را با یک شب مجانی جبران کرد. Hotel eshtebâhash râ bâ yek shab-e majâni jobrân kard. The hotel made up for its mistake with a free night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also to repay a kindness: lotf-e shomâ râ jobrân mikonam."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "jobrân kardan is built from jobrân 'compensation', a loan usually traced to Arabic jubrān 'mending, setting right', and kardan 'to do'. EtymDB does not list jobrân."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
