              "text": "برگرداندن (bargardândan) — \"to give back, to return (something)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "فروشنده پول ما را برگرداند. Forushande pul-e mâ râ bargardând. The shopkeeper gave our money back."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The causative of bargashtan 'to go back'. Present stem bargardân-: barmigardânam."
            }
          ]
        },
